     <h1 class="title" title="Places to visit in Mehrauli">Shopping in Delhi</h1>
     <div class="entry-content">
<span style="COLOR: #000000">
<p><b>Connaught Place</b></p>
                                        <p>Chandni chowk</p>
                                        <p>Karol Bagh</p>
                                        <p>Lajpat nagar</p>
                                        <p>South Extension</p>
                                        <p>Rani Bagh</p>
                                        
                                        <p><b><a href="https://www.connaught-place.com/">Connaught Place or CP</a> </b>&nbsp;is a 
                                            center of Delhi.&nbsp; Palika Bazaar, Janpath are main shopping area. Connaught 
                                            circus has good restaurants, branded shos.</p>
                                        <p>Chandni chowk in Old Delhi is bazaar built in old style. It was built by Shahjhan 
                                            in 1650. &nbsp;It was center of commercial 
                                            activities of Mughal Empire and the legend continues till few years back. Till 
                                            2000 people used to go to Chandni chowk for doing marriage shopping , jewelry 
                                            shopping.&nbsp; With Shopping malls opening in Delhi, the trend is shifting.&nbsp; 
                                            Traditional shopper still go to Chandni chowk.
											For marriages and special event you can visit <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/delhi-destinations/kinari-bazar.aspx">Kinari Bazar</a>.
											</span></p>
                                        <p><a href="https://www.lajpatnagar.co.in/">Lajpat Nagar</a> and<a 
                                                href="https://www.south-ex.com/"> South Extension</a> are next to each 
                                            other.&nbsp; These are residential areas with famous markets.&nbsp; Central market is in 
                                            Lajpat Nagar. </p>
                                        <p>&nbsp;</p>
                                        <p>Delhi and nearby areas are also called NCR - National Capital region. It includes 
                                            Gurgeon, Faridabad, Noida, Ghaziabad.&nbsp; These cities in NCR region too have 
                                            great shopping mall.&nbsp; If you are going from Delhi to Jaipur - Gurgeon is on 
                                            the way.&nbsp; If you are going from Delhi to agra - Noida and Faridabad are 2 
                                            common ways.</p>
                                        <p>&nbsp;</p>
                                        <p>There is lot of development happening even in <a href="https://www.palwal.org/">
                                            Palwal</a> which is on the way to Agra.</p>
                                        &nbsp;<br />
